宇宙就像一锅充斥着各种粒子的热汤，
it was like a dense soup filled with particles.

677
00:37:25,730 --> 00:37:28,270
随着宇宙的发展，它变得更大了，
As the universe evolved and it grew bigger,

678
00:37:28,270 --> 00:37:30,650
热汤逐渐冷却下来。
that soup really cooled off.

679
00:37:31,660 --> 00:37:34,760
今天我们能够测量
Today, we can sample the temperature

680
00:37:34,760 --> 00:37:38,810
整个宇宙中这些原始辐射的温度，
of that primordial radiation across the universe.

681
00:37:38,810 --> 00:37:40,710
我们对小块不同的
We take measurements of huge numbers

682
00:37:40,710 --> 00:37:42,850
微波辐射区域进行测量，
of tiny microwave patches,

683
00:37:42,850 --> 00:37:46,380
很像Dragan对他业余爱好进行的
pretty much the way we would do a statistical analysis

684
00:37:46,390 --> 00:37:50,020
统计学分析——篮球。
of Dragan's favorite pastime - basketball.

685
00:37:51,020 --> 00:37:53,990
我很喜欢打篮球，
I really love basketball,

686
00:37:53,990 --> 00:37:55,430
篮球场非常合适用来
and basketball court is a really good place

687
00:37:55,430 --> 00:37:58,330
解释这些宇宙微波背景的分布。
to explain these cosmic microwave background alignments.

688
00:37:58,330 --> 00:38:00,900
球场上的是Jimmy King，
Here on the basketball court, we have, uh, Jimmy King,

689
00:38:00,900 --> 00:38:02,950
前密歇根大学的篮球传奇，
former University of Michigan basketball legend,

690
00:38:02,950 --> 00:38:04,640
还有他的好兄弟，Willie Vance，
and his buddy Willie Vance.

691
00:38:04,640 --> 00:38:06,340
他们会通过投篮
They will show us alignments

692
00:38:06,340 --> 00:38:10,210
向我们展示宇宙微波背景的分布。
and a cosmic microwave background using their shooting.

693
00:38:12,180 --> 00:38:14,810
从篮筐上方看球场
Looking out from the hoop onto the court

694
00:38:14,820 --> 00:38:16,820
就像是从地球上
is a lot like looking up from earth

695
00:38:16,820 --> 00:38:19,680
看整个宇宙的微波背景。
to see the cosmic microwave background.

696
00:38:19,690 --> 00:38:23,920
Dragan用比赛中每次投篮命中和未命中
Dragan can compare the made and missed shots in the game

697
00:38:23,920 --> 00:38:29,330
来比作早期宇宙的温度波动。
to the temperature fluctuations he sees in the early universe.

698
00:38:29,330 --> 00:38:31,100
就像整个宇宙微波背景中
Just like we have hot and cold spots

699
00:38:31,100 --> 00:38:33,300
存在热点和冷点的波动，
in the cosmic microwave background fluctuations,

700
00:38:33,300 --> 00:38:35,130
投篮也有命中和失误。
we have makes and misses in basketball.

701
00:38:35,130 --> 00:38:39,870
我们用红点表示投球命中，
So, we can represent each make with the red

702
00:38:39,870 --> 00:38:40,950
蓝点代表未命中，
and miss with the blue.

703
00:38:43,740 --> 00:38:45,810
Dragan在半个球场中
Dragan maps the distribution

704
00:38:45,810 --> 00:38:47,580
绘制进球和未进的概率分布，
of makes and misses across the half court.

705
00:38:48,580 --> 00:38:51,310
这种分布是均匀的，
The results show an even distribution,

706
00:38:51,320 --> 00:38:55,070
而且两个半场的分布也是对称的。
one that's symmetrical on both sides of the half court.

707
00:38:55,070 --> 00:38:58,290
如果Jimmy和Willie从一点投球命中，
If Jimmy and Willie hit a shot from one spot,

708
00:38:58,290 --> 00:39:00,890
那么他们在对面半场
they can probably hit the same shot

709
00:39:00,890 --> 00:39:03,590
也有同样的命中概率。
on the other side of the court.

710
00:39:03,600 --> 00:39:05,430
那么命中和未命中的概率分布
So the distribution of the makes and the misses

711
00:39:05,430 --> 00:39:07,160
在整个球场上都是一样的——
is about the same everywhere on the court -

712
00:39:07,170 --> 00:39:09,400
命中和未命中的分布也均匀。
the same number of makes versus the misses.

713
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:13,370
这也是Fragan和其他研究者
This is what dragan and other researchers

714
00:39:13,370 --> 00:39:16,470
希望在宇宙微波背景中发现的——
expected to find in the cosmic microwave background -

715
00:39:16,470 --> 00:39:20,440
热点和冷点的均匀分布，
an even distribution of hot and cold temperatures

716
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:23,050
无论从哪里观察宇宙都应该是这样。
no matter where you look in the sky.

717
00:39:23,050 --> 00:39:27,320
但当Dragan和他的同事仔细观察宇宙时，
But that's not at all what dragan and his colleagues saw

718
00:39:27,320 --> 00:39:30,750
却发现完全不是这样。
when they looked more closely at the pattern.

719
00:39:30,750 --> 00:39:35,420
他们的发现让人吃惊和困扰，
They found something so startling, so disturbing,

720
00:39:35,430 --> 00:39:43,830
宇宙学家只好称这条分界线为“邪恶轴心”。
cosmologists had no choice but to call it the axis of evil.

721
00:39:43,830 --> 00:39:45,630
天空中这种分布的出现
These alignments in the sky

722
00:39:45,640 --> 00:39:48,070
刚好和当时乔治·W·布什提出的
had been noted around the same time that

723
00:39:48,070 --> 00:39:50,090
邪恶轴心理论处于同一时期，
George W. Bush had his axis of evil,

724
00:39:50,090 --> 00:39:53,180
于是英国的科学家干脆就叫它“邪恶轴心”了，
so they were named by scientists in England, the axis of evil.

725
00:39:53,180 --> 00:39:56,850
但我们并不知道这个轴是不是真的邪恶。
We are not sure the axis is actually evil.

726
00:39:57,850 --> 00:40:01,150
我们通过分析微波背景时发现
What we found analyzing causing microwave background data

727
00:40:01,150 --> 00:40:03,620
这个方向的背景很奇特。
was instead, that one direction was special.

728
00:40:03,620 --> 00:40:06,690
在篮球比赛中，这就像是相对于篮筐来说，
So, in basketball terms, it's almost as if one direction,

729
00:40:06,690 --> 00:40:08,790
某个方向上的球场地板发生了倾斜。
relative to the basket, were tilted.

730
00:40:08,790 --> 00:40:10,840
如果Jimmy和Willie
If a corner of the court

731
00:40:10,840 --> 00:40:13,900
正在比赛的球场地面突然移动...
that Jimmy and Willie are playing on suddenly shifted...

732
00:40:22,240 --> 00:40:25,070
...地板以某个角度向下沉，
...so that it now dropped off at an angle,

733
00:40:25,080 --> 00:40:28,180
那从这个区域投篮的命中率就很低。
it would make it harder to make a shot from that area.

734
00:40:30,680 --> 00:40:34,180
整个球场上命中和未命中的均匀分布
The even distribution of makes and misses across the court

735
00:40:34,180 --> 00:40:36,920
就会被破坏。
would suddenly be disrupted.

736
00:40:36,920 --> 00:40:40,390
在球场的这个方向上我们会看到更多的蓝点，
We see more blue dots in the direction of the court.

737
00:40:40,390 --> 00:40:41,660
你就会意识到
And so you conclude that something is off

738
00:40:41,660 --> 00:40:45,390
篮球场上发生了什么。
about the basketball court.

739
00:40:45,400 --> 00:40:48,200
如果篮球场并不平坦，
If a basketball court were not flat,

740
00:40:48,200 --> 00:40:50,850
你就知道有些严重的问题产生了。
you would know something was seriously wrong.

741
00:40:51,730 --> 00:40:56,540
同样，Dragan意识到宇宙中发生了什么。
Dragan feels the same way about the universe.

742
00:40:56,540 --> 00:40:59,010
在宇宙微波背景的波动中，
In the cosmic microwave background fluctuations,

743
00:40:59,010 --> 00:41:00,310
我们发现宇宙的
we see that the structure

744
00:41:00,310 --> 00:41:02,410
高温和低温区并不均匀，
of the hot and cold spots is different,

745
00:41:02,410 --> 00:41:04,730
它们特定的位于在天空的某个方向上，
that they line up in one direction in the sky

746
00:41:04,730 --> 00:41:07,450
而不是在各个方向上均匀分布，
differently than they do in all the other directions,

747
00:41:07,450 --> 00:41:09,380
这样的情况或许就是在告诉我们
and that, maybe, tells us that something is different

748
00:41:09,390 --> 00:41:12,190
宇宙中的这个方向上有什么东西在。
in that special direction in the universe.

749
00:41:13,190 --> 00:41:15,220
最大的热点和冷点
The largest hot and cold spots

750
00:41:15,220 --> 00:41:19,330
沿着将宇宙分割的轴线两端不均匀分布，
are aligned along an axis that cuts right across the cosmos.

751
00:41:19,330 --> 00:41:20,840
这就表明
The results suggest

752
00:41:20,850 --> 00:41:25,570
宇宙的结构发生了扭曲，
that the shape of the universe is somehow distorted.

753
00:41:25,570 --> 00:41:30,770
但又是什么东西能够将整个宇宙弯曲呢？
But what could alter the shape of the entire universe?

754
00:41:30,770 --> 00:41:32,410
我们还不能完全确定导致这样的原因，
We are still not completely sure what the cause is.

755
00:41:32,410 --> 00:41:33,870
只是偶然这样，
Is it just a fluke,

756
00:41:34,480 --> 00:41:38,440
还是早期宇宙中有什么特别的因素存在？
or is it that there is a reason from the early universe?

757
00:41:38,450 --> 00:41:41,300
“邪恶轴心”的存在
It could be, also, that this evil of axis alignments

758
00:41:41,300 --> 00:41:44,550
也可能是由于其他不可见物质造成的，
are caused by structures that we cannot see,

759
00:41:44,550 --> 00:41:47,020
而这些物质就在那里，
and yet they're there,

760
00:41:47,020 --> 00:41:48,870
是它们创造了这样的分布。
and they are creating the alignments.

761
00:41:51,660 --> 00:41:55,530
就像光明世界的结构被暗物质影响，
Just as a world of light was shaped by dark matter,

762
00:41:55,530 --> 00:41:58,150
整个宇宙的结构或许被一些
the entire universe may have been shaped

763
00:41:58,150 --> 00:42:00,100
更加黑暗的物质影响，
by an even darker entity.

764
00:42:00,100 --> 00:42:04,340
黑暗之中是否还有另一个影子宇宙
Could the shadow universe have a shadow,

765
00:42:04,340 --> 00:42:10,110
控制着现有的时空结构？
something that controls the very fabric of space and time?

766
00:42:10,110 --> 00:42:13,310
我们曾认为夜晚的黑暗
We used to see the black of night

767
00:42:13,310 --> 00:42:19,320
代表了虚无，可黑暗并非真的空空如也，
as the epitome of nothingness, but the darkness isn't empty.

768
00:42:19,320 --> 00:42:21,650
到处都是神秘的物质
It's full of strange material

769
00:42:21,660 --> 00:42:25,490
影响着现今宇宙中
that has shaped our universe of atoms and light

770
00:42:25,490 --> 00:42:27,330
所有的物质。
into what it is today.

771
00:42:27,330 --> 00:42:30,710
接着，整个宇宙中的暗物质
In turn, that cosmos of dark matter

772
00:42:30,720 --> 00:42:34,130
或许只是一个
could be a mere spot on the surface

773
00:42:34,140 --> 00:42:37,590
更广阔世界中的一个小点，
of some far bigger plane of reality.

774
00:42:37,590 --> 00:42:42,170
这个阴影宇宙或许是超越时空的存在——
The shadow universe could exist beyond space and time -

775
00:42:42,180 --> 00:42:47,800
而我们才刚刚意识到这片疆域。
a realm we can now only begin to dream of understanding.

